WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.473
The teaching database includes several examples
because reshaping appears in many domains Admissions

00:00:07.499 --> 00:00:13.285
and sales begin in long form Monthly sales and
patient metrics begin

00:00:13.298 --> 00:00:19.031
in wide form Survey responses and grades are useful
for matrix-style

00:00:19.058 --> 00:00:24.723
pivots The different examples help you focus on the
reshape pattern rather

00:00:24.736 --> 00:00:26.446
than memorizing one dataset
